    "name": "Ninth Hotel",
    "steam_appid": 3393140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a Hotel by accident</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the list of how to deal with abnormal symptoms around the starting point</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape by going down to the first floor while carefully observing your surroundings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out all the signs of abnormality in the hallway</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If abnormalities are found, you can move on after solving them through coping with abnormalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't find any abnormalities, you can just move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninth Hotel is an escape simulator inspired by the Neapolitan horror stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no signs of abnormality on the ninth floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check out this ninth floor in detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the eighth floor, there are various types of abnormalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From easily identifiable anomalies to those that need to be closely watched, don't let your guard down</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please go down to the first floor safely and escape while checking and avoiding abnormalities within the given time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't escape within the given time, the scariest fear will hit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[the way of playing]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>moving</strong>: WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump</strong>: Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flash</strong>: right-click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Warning *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flash usage time is limited. Use only when necessary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Playtime]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 to 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting options provide graphics, sound-related adjustment options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be available in English, Korean, Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Korean language support to be provided)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a Hotel by accident</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the list of how to deal with abnormal symptoms around the starting point</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape by going down to the first floor while carefully observing your surroundings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out all the signs of abnormality in the hallway</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If abnormalities are found, you can move on after solving them through coping with abnormalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't find any abnormalities, you can just move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninth Hotel is an escape simulator inspired by the Neapolitan horror stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no signs of abnormality on the ninth floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check out this ninth floor in detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the eighth floor, there are various types of abnormalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From easily identifiable anomalies to those that need to be closely watched, don't let your guard down</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please go down to the first floor safely and escape while checking and avoiding abnormalities within the given time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't escape within the given time, the scariest fear will hit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[the way of playing]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>moving</strong>: WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump</strong>: Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flash</strong>: right-click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Warning *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flash usage time is limited. Use only when necessary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 